  "checkingScope": "主結果と§§2–6の証明本文を読み、核心の接続を整理した。下記外部入力は記述と適用を照合。主張全体の独立検証・査読済みを意味しない。",
  "statements": [
    {
      "result": "Theorem 1.1",
      "pages": "2",
      "hypotheses": "Smooth connected complex projective Fano X, n>0, rho_X the Picard number, iota_X the pseudoindex.",
      "conclusion": "rho_X(iota_X−1)≤n, with equality iff X≅(P^(iota_X−1))^rho_X.",
      "checking": "原典の仮定・結論・等号の双方向を日英に照合。"
    },
    {
      "result": "Proposition 3.1",
      "pages": "6",
      "hypotheses": "iota≥2, β represented by a nonconstant free map, d=−K·β, embedding by −aK.",
      "conclusion": "〈τ_(d−2)(pt)〉_β≥(ad)^(−(d−1)).",
      "checking": "pp.6–10の証明本文を読解。スタックの重み、境界像、pushforwardを区別。"
    },
    {
      "result": "Proposition 4.1",
      "pages": "11",
      "hypotheses": "Quantum-divisor matrices over the algebraic closure of C(q_1,…,q_r).",
      "conclusion": "Some joint diagonal tuple is algebraically independent over C.",
      "checking": "pp.11–13の漸化式、反復、下界との比較を読解。"
    },
    {
      "result": "Proposition 5.3",
      "pages": "15",
      "hypotheses": "Same Fano assumptions.",
      "conclusion": "Independent γ_1,…,γ_r with nonzero ordered S-product; r(iota−1)≤n.",
      "checking": "Lemmas5.1–5.2と展開(15)から次数評価へ進む箇所を読解。"
    },
    {
      "result": "Proposition 6.4",
      "pages": "17",
      "hypotheses": "Equality r(iota−1)=n, iota≥2.",
      "conclusion": "X≅(P^(iota−1))^r.",
      "checking": "Lemma6.3、corrected chain bound、巡回操作、Occhettaへの適用を照合。"
    }
  ],
  "proofPassages": [
    {
      "section": "§2, Lemma 2.1, (1)–(5)",
      "pages": "3–5",
      "read": "量子因子の次数、可換性と斉次性。divisor/TRR/string、不安定な次数零項の区別。"
    },
    {
      "section": "§§3.1–3.4, Proposition 3.1, Lemma 3.2",
      "pages": "6–10",
      "read": "very general point、評価ファイバー、族の縮約、重み付き係数、境界像、Chow localization、単項式退化による次数下界。"
    },
    {
      "section": "Lemma 3.3",
      "pages": "10–11",
      "read": "free次数の加法閉性、生成、comb smoothing、Zariski稠密性。"
    },
    {
      "section": "§§4.1–4.2, Proposition 4.1, (6)–(11)",
      "pages": "11–13",
      "read": "階乗正規化、有限シフト、斉次関係式、固定pでの差分、線形回数の反復とStirling下界。p.11画像でLの代数閉包のバーを確認。"
    },
    {
      "section": "§5, Lemmas 5.1–5.2, Proposition 5.3, (12)–(15)",
      "pages": "13–15",
      "read": "同時共役と基底微分、交代化、補間多項式によるtuple選別、非零項抽出、次数。交換子全項の独立検算は保留。"
    },
    {
      "section": "§6, Theorems 6.1–6.2, Lemma 6.3, Proposition 6.4",
      "pages": "16–17",
      "read": "最小degree、台とincidence chain、full proper components、endpoint locus、巡回、積の特徴付けと逆向き。"
    }
  ],
